#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1
msgid "Distribution customization"
msgstr "发行版定制"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:3
msgid ""
"A distribution can use the standard HybridInference website, apply its own branding and operating"
" policy, or build its own public pages while sharing the console and authentication logic. Choose"
" the smallest interface that covers your requirements; each option has a different build and "
"upgrade cost."
msgstr "发行版可以使用 HybridInference 的标准网站，配置自己的品牌和运营策略，也可以自行开发公开页面，同时共用控制台和认证逻辑。请选择能够满足需求的最小接口；各方案的构建与升级成本不同。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:8
msgid ""
"The standard application provides default home, account and terms pages, dashboard, API-key "
"management, Playground, request history and the admin console. Authentication, persistence, "
"email, model providers and optional services still need their documented deployment "
"configuration. The [Router Tutorial](router-tutorial.md) runs a local example from inference "
"through the Web/Admin Console."
msgstr ""
"标准应用提供默认首页、账号页和条款页，以及仪表盘、API 密钥管理、Playground、请求历史和管理控制台。认证、持久化、邮件、模型提供商及可选服务仍需按照各自文档完成部署配置。[路由器教程"
"](router-tutorial.md)提供了从推理到 Web／管理控制台的本地运行示例。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:15
msgid "1. What you can customize"
msgstr "1\\. 能改什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:17
msgid ""
"“Runtime configuration” below means configuration read by the running services; it does not mean "
"every file is watched or that an open browser updates live. The filenames below follow the "
"example layout; manifest paths can name other files in your distribution."
msgstr "下文中的“运行时配置”是指由运行中的服务读取的配置，并不表示每个文件都有变更监听，也不表示已打开的浏览器页面会实时更新。以下文件名采用示例目录结构；清单中的路径可以指向发行版内的其他文件。"

