#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:37
msgid ""
"There is no configuration field for an arbitrary home-page hero and no public interface for "
"replacing the console's overall theme, sidebar or layout. Adding a navigation link does not "
"register a route. A localized home page does not imply a fully localized console; module wording,"
" page titles and document language are covered under [Your public pages](#your-public-pages)."
msgstr ""
"目前没有用于任意首页主视觉区域的配置字段，也没有替换控制台整体主题、侧边栏或布局的公开接口。添加导航链接不会注册路由。首页本地化并不意味着整个控制台都已本地化；模块文案、页面标题与文档语言的说明见[自有公开页面"
"](#your-public-pages)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:43
msgid "2. Configuration-only customization"
msgstr "2\\. 只改配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:45
msgid ""
"Start with the annotated `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` and "
"`config/examples/branding.example.yaml`. Keep deployment-owned files in your distribution "
"repository or overlay, with credentials in the environment. Use the standard frontend image with "
"no Site UI selection to keep the default page layouts. Reusing that image assumes its compiled "
"backend network target matches your deployment; see [When changes take effect](#when-changes-"
"take-effect)."
msgstr ""
"从带注释的 `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` 和 `config/examples/branding.example.yaml` "
"开始。将部署自有文件保存在发行版仓库或覆盖层中，凭据放在环境变量里。使用标准前端镜像，不选择 Site UI "
"模块，即可保留默认页面布局。复用该镜像的前提是其编译时确定的后端网络目标地址与你的部署一致；请参阅[变更何时生效](#when-changes-take-effect)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:52
msgid "Where your files live"
msgstr "文件放在哪里"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:54
msgid ""
"A real deployment's configuration lives in a **distribution overlay**: one directory under "
"`distributions/` holding that deployment's manifest, config files, Compose/env inputs, and "
"branding."
msgstr ""
"真实部署的配置放在 **distribution overlay** 里：`distributions/` 下的一个目录，装着该部署的 manifest、配置文件、Compose/env "
"输入和品牌信息。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:69
msgid ""
"The split exists so the source tree and the container image stay neutral. Model IDs, upstream "
"base URLs, ports, site identity and branding are properties of one deployment, not of the "
"project; keeping them in an overlay means the image can be built once and a deployment's overlay "
"mounted into it (`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` mounts the overlay read-only rather than "
"baking it into the image). It also means a clone of this repository ships nobody's hosts."
msgstr ""
"这样拆分，是为了让源码树和容器镜像保持中立。模型 id、上游 base URL、端口、站点标识和品牌，都属于某一个部署，而不属于项目本身；把它们放进 "
"overlay，镜像就可以只构建一次，再把某个部署的 overlay 挂载进去（`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` 以只读方式挂载 "
"overlay，而不是把它打包进镜像）。这也意味着，从本仓库克隆下来的代码不会带上任何人的主机地址。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:76
msgid ""
"For config-path precedence and admin overrides, see [Configuration](configuration.md#how-a"
"-gateway-finds-its-config)."
msgstr "配置路径的优先级和管理覆盖设置见[配置](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:79
msgid "The distribution manifest"
msgstr "distribution manifest"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:81
msgid ""
"A manifest is one versioned YAML document that names a deployment and tells the gateway where its"
" config files are. `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` is the annotated reference. Both "
"examples below and in that file close public signup when activated; change `public_signup` to "
"`true` or null if this deployment should accept new accounts through the public signup API:"
msgstr ""
"manifest 是一份带版本号的 YAML 文档，它给部署命名，并告诉网关这个部署的配置文件在哪里。`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` "
"是带注释的参考。下方和该文件中的示例在激活后都会关闭公开注册；如果部署应该接受公开注册 API 创建的新账号，请把 `public_signup` 改为 `true` 或 null："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:113
msgid ""
"`schema_version` must be `1`. `distribution.id` identifies the distribution; `display_name` is "
"its public name, and `release` records its version. `deployment.target` records an operator label"
" such as `local` or `staging`; it does not select a host, build an image or deploy a service."
msgstr ""
"`schema_version` 必须为 `1`。`distribution.id` 标识发行版，`display_name` 是公开名称，`release` "
"记录版本。`deployment.target` 记录 `local` 或 `staging` 等运维标签；它不会选择主机、构建镜像或部署服务。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:118
msgid ""
"`paths.models`, `paths.routing` and `paths.alerts` select gateway configuration files. Relative "
"paths are resolved from the manifest directory; explicit gateway environment overrides still take"
" precedence. `paths.mcp` and the legal-document fields are accepted but have the limitations "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"`paths.models`、`paths.routing` 和 `paths.alerts` 用于选择网关配置文件。相对路径从清单所在目录解析；显式设置的网关环境变量仍有更高优先级。清单接受 "
"`paths.mcp` 和法律文档字段，但存在下文所述限制。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:123
msgid "Point the gateway at it with two environment variables:"
msgstr "用两个环境变量把网关指向它："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:130
msgid ""
"With an active manifest, `features.public_signup: false` disables both the signup UI and `POST "
"/auth/signup` (HTTP 403, without creating an account). Neither `SIGNUP_ENABLED=true` nor a "
"runtime `signup_enabled=true` override can reopen it. To enable public signup, change the "
"manifest to `true` or leave the field unset/null and restart the backend, then ensure the "
"effective `signup_enabled` setting is enabled."
msgstr ""
"在 active 模式下，manifest 中的 `features.public_signup: false` 会同时关闭注册界面和 `POST /auth/signup`（返回 HTTP "
"403，不创建账号）。`SIGNUP_ENABLED=true` 和运行时的 `signup_enabled=true` 覆盖值都不能重新开启注册。要开放公开注册，请将 manifest "
"中该字段改为 `true` 或留空/null，重启后端，并确保最终生效的 `signup_enabled` 设置已开启。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:137
msgid ""
"The admin API rejects attempts to set `signup_enabled=true` while the active manifest disables "
"signup (HTTP 400, without saving the setting). Manifest root and `features` fields reject unknown"
" keys, including `public-signup`, `publicSignup`, or a `public_signup` field at the manifest "
"root."
msgstr ""
"active manifest 关闭注册时，管理员 API 会拒绝设置 `signup_enabled=true`（返回 HTTP 400，不保存设置）。manifest 根节点和 "
"`features` 会拒绝未知字段，包括 `public-signup`、`publicSignup`，以及写在 manifest 根节点的 `public_signup`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:142
msgid ""
"When the manifest allows signup, the runtime `signup_enabled` setting takes precedence over "
"`SIGNUP_ENABLED` (default `true`). The same rule applies with no manifest or in dark mode; dark-"
"mode feature values have no effect. `GET /site-config` reports the resulting boolean in "
"`features.public_signup`, so the console follows the backend policy. Email verification, domain-"
"based approval, and quotas remain separate checks; allowing registration does not bypass them."
msgstr ""
"当 manifest 允许注册时，运行时 `signup_enabled` 设置优先于 `SIGNUP_ENABLED`（默认 `true`）。未配置 manifest 或使用 dark "
"模式时也遵循同一规则；dark 模式下的功能字段不影响实际行为。`GET /site-config` 在 `features.public_signup` "
"中返回最终布尔值，使控制台与后端策略一致。邮箱验证、按域名审批和配额仍是独立检查，允许注册不会绕过它们。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:150
msgid ""
"If a runtime signup-setting read fails or exceeds one second, the gateway temporarily disables "
"public signup. A valid `/site-config` response still returns HTTP 200 with its identity and "
"branding intact and `public_signup: false`; registration returns HTTP 403 without creating an "
"account. It does not fall back to an environment value that could reopen registration."
msgstr ""
"如果运行时注册设置读取失败或超过一秒，网关会暂时关闭公开注册。有效的 `/site-config` 响应仍返回 HTTP 200，保留站点身份和品牌，并返回 `public_signup: "
"false`；注册返回 HTTP 403，不创建账号。系统不会回退到可能重新开放注册的环境变量值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:157
msgid ""
"Because `/site-config` is unauthenticated and read while rendering every console page, the "
"gateway does not repeat a failing read for every request. Callers that arrive together while the "
"setting's cache is cold share one store round-trip, and a failed read is reused for five seconds,"
" so an outage costs one timeout per window rather than one per request. Recovery needs no "
"restart: the window expires on its own, and writing `signup_enabled` through the administrator "
"API clears it at once."
msgstr ""
"由于 `/site-config` "
"无需鉴权，且每次渲染控制台页面都会读取它，网关不会为每个请求重复一次失败的读取。缓存尚未预热时并发到达的调用方共享同一次存储往返，失败的读取会复用五秒，因此一次故障只在每个窗口内产生一次超时，而不是每个请求各产生一次。恢复无需重启：该窗口会自行过期，通过管理员"
" API 写入 `signup_enabled` 也会立即清除它。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:165
msgid "Dark mode is the default, and that is deliberate"
msgstr "默认是 dark 模式，这是有意为之"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:167
msgid ""
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` defaults to `dark`. In dark mode the manifest is loaded and validated,"
" and the resolver logs what it *would* change, but current resolution stays effective:"
msgstr "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 默认为 `dark`。dark 模式下，manifest 会被加载并校验，解析器把它*本来会*改动的内容记进日志，但当前的解析结果仍然有效："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:177
msgid ""
"Setting only `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` therefore cannot change behaviour; you get a warning "
"telling you the mode defaulted to `dark`. Config-path resolution treats an unrecognised mode as "
"`dark` with a warning. Signup, `/site-config`, and the RAG feature policy are stricter: an "
"explicitly empty or unknown mode, or `active` without a manifest path, closes signup (HTTP 403), "
"makes `/site-config` report an unavailable configuration (HTTP 503), and makes authenticated "
"`/v1/rag/status` and `/v1/rag/chat` requests return HTTP 503. Only an unset mode defaults to "
"`dark`, including in Compose. Enable a manifest by running dark first, reading the comparison "
"lines, and only then setting `active`."
msgstr ""
"因此，只设置 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 不会改变行为；系统会警告模式默认使用了 `dark`。配置路径解析会把无法识别的模式视为 `dark` 并记录警告。注册"
"、`/site-config` 和 RAG 功能策略要求更严格：显式空值、未知模式，或选择 `active` 却未设置 manifest 路径时，会关闭注册（HTTP 403），让 "
"`/site-config` 报告配置不可用（HTTP 503），并让已鉴权的 `/v1/rag/status` 和 `/v1/rag/chat` 请求返回 HTTP "
"503。只有未设置模式时才默认使用 `dark`，Compose 中也是如此。启用 manifest 时，应先运行 dark 模式、检查比较日志，再设置为 `active`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:187
msgid ""
"Mode warnings are logged once per distinct value per process. When diagnosing RAG configuration "
"errors, check the startup logs and the backend's effective `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` and "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`, rather than expecting the warning to repeat on every request. Correct"
" the values and restart the backend. See [Docs RAG Assistant](rag-chat.md) for the feature "
"restriction."
msgstr ""
"每个进程对每个不同的模式值只记录一次警告。排查 RAG 配置错误时，请检查启动日志及后端实际使用的 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 和 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`，不要期待每次请求都重复警告。修正取值后重启后端。功能限制详见[文档 RAG 助手](rag-chat.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:193
msgid ""
"Failure behaviour differs by mode, on purpose. In dark mode a manifest that will not load is "
"logged and skipped. In active mode the manifest *is* where the paths come from, so a manifest "
"that will not load — a lost overlay mount, a YAML error — refuses to start rather than quietly "
"serving a different registry."
msgstr ""
"失败行为按模式区分，这是刻意的。dark 模式下，加载不了的 manifest 只被记录并跳过。active 模式下，路径*正是*从 manifest 来的，所以加载不了的 "
"manifest——overlay 挂载丢了、YAML 写错了——会拒绝启动，而不是悄悄用另一份注册表对外服务。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:198
msgid ""
"The manifest root and `features` are closed schemas: unknown keys are rejected, including "
"misspelled feature names or feature flags placed at the root. This changes the earlier behavior "
"that silently ignored these keys. Before upgrading an active deployment, validate its actual "
"overlay with the new backend code; the repository's example manifests do not validate privately "
"maintained overlays. Correct misspellings and keep operator-specific metadata in a separate file."
" With `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` set to the deployed manifest, run:"
msgstr ""
"manifest 顶层与 `features` 使用封闭 schema：未知键会被拒绝，包括拼错的功能名称以及误放到顶层的功能开关。这改变了此前静默忽略这些键的行为。升级 active "
"部署前，请用新后端代码校验实际 overlay；仓库内的示例 manifest 不能替代对私有 overlay 的校验。请修正拼写，并将运维人员自定义的元数据保存在独立文件中。将 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 设为部署中的 manifest 路径后运行："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:217
msgid ""
"This is not exhaustive typo detection: `paths`, `site`, `distribution`, and `deployment` still "
"ignore unknown section keys for compatibility. In particular, check `paths.models` and the "
"resolved model-registry log before activating an overlay; an unknown path key is treated as an "
"omitted path and can select a legacy default. Strict validation of those sections is a separate "
"compatibility change."
msgstr ""
"这不是完整的拼写错误检测：为了兼容，`paths`、`site`、`distribution` 和 `deployment` 仍会忽略各节内的未知键。启用 overlay 前，尤其要检查 "
"`paths.models` 和解析后的模型注册表日志；未知的路径键会被当作未配置路径处理，从而可能选择旧默认值。收紧这些节的校验属于另一项兼容性变更。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:224
msgid ""
"If an invalid active manifest reaches the HTTP handlers, signup remains closed and `/site-config`"
" returns HTTP 503 without exposing file paths or parser errors. It cannot return a valid identity"
" until the manifest is repaired."
msgstr ""
"如果 HTTP 处理函数遇到无效的 active manifest，注册保持关闭，`/site-config` 返回 HTTP 503，不暴露文件路径或解析错误。在 manifest "
"修复前，接口无法返回有效的站点身份。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:228
msgid "Identity, and what the manifest must not contain"
msgstr "站点标识，以及 manifest 里不能放什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:230
msgid ""
"`site:` and `features:` are served as a public subset by `GET /site-config`, and "
"`distribution.display_name` / `site:` feed backend-rendered content (transactional emails, "
"attribution headers) through `get_site_identity()` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/site_identity.py`. Both are gated on "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`; in dark mode `/site-config` returns a neutral document and "
"identity falls back to `SITE_NAME` / `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` / `SITE_DOCS_URL` / "
"`SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL` or to neutral defaults."
msgstr ""
"`site:` 和 `features:` 会由 `GET /site-config` 以公开子集的形式对外提供；`distribution.display_name` 与 `site:` "
"则通过 `apps/backend/serving/config/site_identity.py` 中的 "
"`get_site_identity()`，供给后端渲染的内容（事务性邮件、署名头）。两者都以 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 为前提；在 dark 模式下"
"，`/site-config` 返回一份中立文档，站点标识回退到 `SITE_NAME` / `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` / `SITE_DOCS_URL` / "
"`SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL`，或者回退到中立的默认值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:238
msgid ""
"Manifests must not contain secrets. Credentials stay in the environment, and `schema_version: 1` "
"deliberately does not interpolate environment variables into manifest values."
msgstr "manifest 里绝不能放密钥。凭据留在环境变量里，而且 `schema_version: 1` 有意不把环境变量插值进 manifest 的取值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:242
msgid "Runtime branding"
msgstr "运行时品牌配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:244
msgid ""
"Copy the complete `config/examples/branding.example.yaml`, set its public values, and point "
"`site.branding` at it. The path is relative to the manifest's directory. Set the site's name in "
"`distribution.display_name`; a display name alone, without a branding document, does not replace "
"the frontend's default name. The branding document is validated at backend startup and exposed "
"through `/site-config`, so every value in it must be safe for a visitor to read."
msgstr ""
"复制完整的 `config/examples/branding.example.yaml`，设置其中的公开值，并通过 `site.branding` 指向它。路径相对于清单所在目录。在 "
"`distribution.display_name` 中设置站点名称；如果没有品牌文档，仅设置显示名称不会替换前端的默认名称。品牌文档在后端启动时校验，并通过 `/site-config` "
"公开，因此其中的每个值都必须可以安全地提供给访客阅读。"

