msgstr "默认首页的赞助商图片：`name`、`alt`、`src`、`class_name`、`width`、`height`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:267
msgid ""
"Use the template and the schema in `serving/config/branding.py` for permitted values. Branding "
"rejects unknown keys; required fields cannot simply be omitted. For optional content, use the "
"documented empty strings/lists. Sponsor `class_name` accepts the schema's supported image-size "
"classes, not arbitrary CSS. No branding field supplies a universal palette, font or page layout. "
"Custom page components decide which runtime branding values they render."
msgstr ""
"允许的值见模板和 `serving/config/branding.py` 中的数据结构定义。品牌配置会拒绝未知键；不能直接省略必填字段。对于可选内容，请使用文档规定的空字符串／空列表。赞助商的"
" `class_name` 接受数据结构定义中支持的图片尺寸类名，不接受任意 CSS。品牌字段不提供全局配色、字体或页面布局。自定义页面组件自行决定渲染哪些运行时品牌值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:274
msgid ""
"Serve local branding images through the mounted site-assets directory and `/site-assets/*`, or "
"use permitted public asset URLs. Check the URLs over HTTP. A failed or invalid `/site-config` "
"response produces a configuration error instead of silently rendering a working site with "
"different defaults."
msgstr ""
"通过挂载的 site-assets 目录和 `/site-assets/*` 提供本地品牌图片，或使用允许的公开资源 URL。通过 HTTP 检查这些 URL。如果 `/site-config`"
" 响应失败或无效，页面会报配置错误，而不会悄悄使用另一套默认值显示看似正常的站点。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:279
msgid "Feature settings and their limits"
msgstr "功能设置及其限制"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:281
msgid ""
"`features.rag: false` in an active manifest disables the RAG UI and backend access. Allowing RAG "
"still requires the service's configuration; see [Docs RAG Assistant](rag-chat.md)."
msgstr "已启用清单中的 `features.rag: false` 会禁用 RAG UI 和后端访问。允许 RAG 仍需完成服务配置；请参阅[文档 RAG 助手](rag-chat.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:284
msgid ""
"`features.routers` is declared/public metadata. It does not select or restrict the model router; "
"use the model's `router` and supported admin overrides in [Routing](routing.md)."
msgstr "`features.routers` 是声明性／公开元数据，不会选择或限制模型路由器；请使用模型的 `router` 和[路由](routing.md)中受支持的管理覆盖设置。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:287
msgid ""
"`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL`, or the internal agent service destinations, configure the existing agent "
"link/proxy integration. They do not install an agent service. See [The public path table](public-"
"path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL` 或内部 agent 服务目标地址用于配置已有的 agent 链接／代理集成，不会安装 agent 服务。请参阅[公开路径表](public-path-"
"table.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:290
msgid ""
"`site.terms_document` and `site.privacy_document` are accepted manifest fields, but they do not "
"load text into the current terms page. Use the legal-page interface in [Your public pages](#your-"
"public-pages) to publish custom text."
msgstr ""
"清单接受 `site.terms_document` 和 `site.privacy_document` 字段，但当前条款页不会据此加载文本。请使用[自有公开页面](#your-public-"
"pages)中的法律条款页接口发布自定义文本。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:293
msgid ""
"`paths.mcp` is accepted by the resolver, but no component consumes it at this revision. It does "
"not enable a service."
msgstr "配置解析器接受 `paths.mcp`，但当前版本没有组件使用它。它不会启用服务。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:296
msgid ""
"A public branding hint or hidden navigation item is not a substitute for backend authorization. "
"The registration rules above remain effective with a custom UI module."
msgstr "公开的品牌提示或隐藏导航项不能替代后端授权。使用自定义 UI 模块时，上述注册规则仍然生效。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:300
msgid ""
"Model/provider changes made through supported admin APIs take effect on the running gateway and "
"are persisted in its database. They do not rewrite the YAML; stored overrides are applied on top "
"of it again at startup. Account for both layers when investigating a configuration difference. "
"See [Runtime configuration](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"通过受支持的管理 API 修改模型／提供商，会在运行中的网关上生效，并持久化到其数据库。这些修改不会重写 YAML；启动时，已保存的覆盖设置会再次叠加到 YAML "
"之上。排查配置差异时，应同时检查这两层。请参阅[运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:306
msgid "When changes take effect"
msgstr "变更何时生效"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:308
msgid ""
"Restart the backend after changing mounted manifest, branding, model/routing or alert files. "
"Reload the page to check presentation; the backend serves the branding snapshot loaded at "
"startup."
msgstr "修改挂载的清单、品牌、模型／路由或告警文件后重启后端。重新加载页面检查展示；后端提供的是启动时加载的品牌配置快照。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:311
msgid ""
"Replace mounted site-assets files without rebuilding an image. The route allows five minutes of "
"browser caching, so verify the served URL and account for browser/proxy caches. Changing "
"`SITE_ASSETS_DIR` itself requires recreating the frontend container."
msgstr ""
"替换挂载的 site-assets 文件无需重新构建镜像。该路由允许浏览器缓存五分钟，因此请验证实际提供的 URL，并考虑浏览器／代理缓存。修改 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` "
"本身需要重新创建前端容器。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:315
msgid ""
"Recreate the affected container after changing runtime environment values. A plain container "
"restart retains its old environment. Server-only agent destinations are runtime values."
msgstr "修改运行时环境变量后重新创建受影响的容器。仅重启容器会保留原有环境变量。仅供服务器端使用的 agent 目标地址属于运行时值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:318
msgid ""
"Use the admin console/API for supported live edits, and check effective values and any feature-"
"specific caching."
msgstr "通过管理控制台／API 执行受支持的在线修改，并检查实际生效值及该功能的缓存行为。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:320
msgid ""
"Rebuild the frontend after changing true build-only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` values or the backend network"
" target compiled from `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`. These differ from runtime branding and are not "
"changed by a backend restart."
msgstr ""
"修改真正仅在构建时生效的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 值，或由 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` "
"编译确定的后端网络目标地址后，需要重新构建前端。这些与运行时品牌配置不同，不会随后端重启而改变。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:324
msgid ""
"Use runtime branding for identity rather than introducing new build-time branding variables. The "
"precise Compose commands are in [Deployment](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-requires). "
"Rebuild the affected image when configuration or assets are baked into it instead of mounted."
msgstr ""
"请使用运行时品牌配置设置站点标识，避免引入新的构建时品牌变量。具体 Compose 命令见[部署](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-"
"requires)。配置或资源如果打包进镜像而非挂载，变更后需要重新构建受影响的镜像。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:329
msgid "The example distribution"
msgstr "示例 distribution"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:331
msgid ""
"`distributions/example/` is a complete, runnable overlay kept in the repository as a teaching "
"artifact: a manifest, a one-model registry pointing at a bundled fake provider that needs no "
"credential, Compose overlays, and smoke scripts. Walk through it with the [Quickstart](router-"
"tutorial.md):"
msgstr ""
"`distributions/example/` 是一个完整、可运行的 overlay，作为教学用的样例留在仓库里：一份 manifest、一份只含单个模型的注册表（指向随仓库自带、无需凭据的假"
" provider）、Compose overlay，以及冒烟脚本。可以配合[快速开始](router-tutorial.md)走一遍："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:341
msgid ""
"It carries a marker file, `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`, whose presence keeps it out of automatic discovery. "
"The Makefile picks a distribution like this:"
msgstr "它带着一个标记文件 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`，只要这个文件在，它就不会被自动发现选中。Makefile 挑选 distribution 的规则是这样的："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:344
msgid ""
"Overlays are discovered from `distributions/*/deploy/*.env`, minus any directory containing "
"`EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`."
msgstr "overlay 从 `distributions/*/deploy/*.env` 发现，并排除任何含有 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` 的目录。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:346
msgid ""
"Exactly one candidate: it is selected automatically, and `make` prints which identity it is "
"compiling in."
msgstr "恰好只有一个候选：自动选中它，`make` 会打印它正在按哪一个站点标识编译。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:348
msgid "Several candidates: `make` fails and asks you to name one."
msgstr "有多个候选：`make` 失败，并要求你指定其中一个。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:349
msgid ""
"None (the state of a fresh clone of this repository): no overlay is selected, and the stack is "
"neutral."
msgstr "一个都没有（刚克隆本仓库时就是这个状态）：不选任何 overlay，整套服务保持中立。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:352
msgid ""
"`DISTRIBUTION=<name>` selects one by name — including the example, which is only ever selected "
"explicitly. `DISTRIBUTION=none` opts out."
msgstr "`DISTRIBUTION=<name>` 按名字选择——示例也在其中，而它只可能被显式选中。`DISTRIBUTION=none` 表示不选。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:357
msgid "3. Your public pages"
msgstr "3\\. 自己的公开页面"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:359
msgid ""
"A deployment can replace the public pages a visitor sees — the landing page, the frame around the"
" account pages, the legal page — without forking the console. The seam is a **build-time UI "
"module**: a small tree of React components that the frontend image compiles in, alongside the "
"shared application rather than instead of it."
msgstr ""
"部署可以替换访客看到的公开页面，包括首页、账号页面外壳和法律条款页，无需 fork 控制台。扩展方式是 **构建时 UI 模块**：前端镜像将一小组 React "
"组件与共享应用一起编译，而不是用它们替换整个共享应用。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:365
msgid ""
"One Next.js application, one console, one session. A distribution ships a small UI module; the "
"build compiles it in."
msgstr "一个 Next.js 应用、一个控制台、一套会话。发行版提供一个小型 UI 模块，由构建过程编译进应用。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:375
msgid ""
"Here `C` is the upstream source commit and `U` is the distribution's UI source commit. Pin both "
"when building a release. The module is not fetched or swapped at runtime; component, stylesheet "
"and compiled-copy changes require a new frontend image. Runtime branding read by the module "
"retains its runtime behavior."
msgstr ""
"这里的 `C` 是上游源码提交，`U` 是发行版的 UI "
"源码提交。构建发布版本时需同时锁定两者。模块不会在运行时获取或替换；组件、样式表和编译进镜像的文案变更需要新的前端镜像。模块读取的运行时品牌配置仍按运行时配置的方式生效。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:380
msgid "What a module can and cannot change"
msgstr "模块可以修改什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "The module owns"
msgstr "模块负责"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "The shared application keeps"
msgstr "共享应用保留"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the home page, if it exports one"
msgstr "模块导出的首页"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "dashboard, chat, admin, team and authorize pages, and the `/agents` proxy integration"
msgstr "仪表盘、chat、admin、team 和 authorize 页面，以及 `/agents` 代理集成"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the frame around the account pages, and where each field's parts go"
msgstr "账号页面外壳，以及每个字段各部分的位置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the account forms, their fields, validation and submit calls"
msgstr "账号表单、字段、验证与提交请求"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the legal text and the sign-up confirmations, if it ships its own"
msgstr "模块自带的法律文本和注册确认项"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"the consent step, the one `accepted_tos` flag sign-up records, and the terms anchors the account "
"pages link to"
msgstr "注册同意步骤、注册时记录的唯一 `accepted_tos` 标志，以及账号页面引用的条款锚点"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "its own wording for the account pages"
msgstr "账号页面的自有文案"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the schemas, error codes, session handling and redirect rules"
msgstr "数据结构、错误码、会话处理与重定向规则"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the public pages' titles, and the language of the pages it renders"
msgstr "公开页面的标题，以及模块所渲染页面的语言"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "every console page's title and language"
msgstr "所有控制台页面的标题和语言"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "its own stylesheet and design assets"
msgstr "自有样式表与设计资源"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the runtime branding document and `/site-config`"
msgstr "运行时品牌文档与 `/site-config`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:391
msgid ""
"A module cannot change who gets in: the account pages' business logic, the registration gate, the"
" email-verification requirement and the permission rules are all in the shared application and "
"are not part of this interface."
msgstr "模块不能改变访问资格：账号页面的业务逻辑、注册开关、邮箱验证要求和权限规则都属于共享应用，不在此接口范围内。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:395
msgid ""
"The shared application also keeps the session store, proxy rules, and `AuthField` / `AuthNotice` "
"/ `AuthLoading` accessibility behavior. A module cannot register a route or take over an unlisted"
" page. A new path such as `/pricing`, a console redesign or a new authentication method needs an "
"application change beyond this interface."
msgstr ""
"共享应用还保留会话存储、代理规则，以及 `AuthField` / `AuthNotice` / `AuthLoading` 的无障碍行为。模块不能注册路由或接管未列出的页面。新增 "
"`/pricing` 等路径、重新设计控制台或增加认证方式，都需要在此接口范围之外修改应用。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:401
msgid ""
"The host facade exposes public site configuration, resolved branding, session state and the "
"supported presentation types/helpers. Session state lets a page choose a sign-in or console link;"
" the facade does not expose login/logout, tokens or authentication operations. The normative "
"TypeScript interfaces live in `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/contract.ts`, and the supported imports "
"in `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/host.ts`."
msgstr ""
"宿主接口公开站点配置、解析后的品牌配置、会话状态及受支持的展示类型／辅助函数。页面可以根据会话状态选择展示登录链接或控制台链接；该接口不公开登录／退出、令牌或认证操作。规范性的 "
"TypeScript 接口位于 `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/contract.ts`，受支持的导入位于 `apps/frontend/src/site-"
"ui/host.ts`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:408
msgid "What a module may import"
msgstr "模块可以导入什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:410
msgid ""
"A module may import `@site-ui/host`, `react`, `react/*`, `react-dom`, `next`, `next/*` and its "
"own files. Relative imports must stay inside the module. Anything else — in particular `@/...` — "
"fails the build."
msgstr ""
"模块可以导入 `@site-ui/host`、`react`、`react/*`、`react-dom`、`next`、`next/*` 及自身文件。相对导入必须限定在模块内部。其他导入，尤其是"
" `@/...`，会使构建失败。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:414
msgid ""
"The build holds a module to that list where webpack resolves each of its requests, in every "
"compilation Next.js runs, and judges a request by the real path it resolves to rather than by how"
" it is spelled. These fail as well:"
msgstr "构建在 webpack 解析模块每个请求的环节执行这份清单，覆盖 Next.js 运行的每一次编译；判断请求时依据它最终解析到的真实路径，而不是它的写法。以下情况同样会使构建失败："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:418
msgid "a relative path or a symlink that leads out of the module;"
msgstr "指向模块之外的相对路径或符号链接；"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:419
msgid "a framework subpath that walks back out, such as `next/../../src/site-ui/routes`;"
msgstr "借助上级目录跳出框架包的子路径，例如 `next/../../src/site-ui/routes`；"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:420
msgid "a stylesheet `@import` or `url()` that leaves the module;"
msgstr "指向模块之外的样式表 `@import` 或 `url()`；"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:421
msgid ""
"a computed import — `require.context`, `import.meta.webpackContext` or an `import()` of a "
"template literal — over a directory outside the module;"
msgstr "作用于模块外目录的计算式导入，包括 `require.context`、`import.meta.webpackContext` 或以模板字符串调用的 `import()`；"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:423
msgid "a `data:` or `file:` URI, or a Node.js built-in;"
msgstr "`data:` 或 `file:` URI，以及 Node.js 内置模块；"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:424
msgid "an inline loader other than Next.js's own, such as `!!raw-loader!./notes.txt`;"
msgstr "Next.js 自带 loader 以外的内联 loader，例如 `!!raw-loader!./notes.txt`；"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:425
msgid ""
"anything in a `node_modules` directory inside the module. A module's dependencies come from the "
"application's lockfile, and staging does not copy that directory."
msgstr "模块内部 `node_modules` 目录中的任何内容。模块的依赖来自应用的锁文件，暂存步骤也不会复制该目录。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:429
msgid ""
"The build also admits the helpers Next.js's compiler adds to a module's code, `@swc/helpers` and "
"`styled-jsx`, resolved from Next.js itself. A module does not import them by name."
msgstr "构建还允许 Next.js 编译器注入到模块代码中的辅助库 `@swc/helpers` 和 `styled-jsx`，它们从 Next.js 自身解析。模块不会按名称导入它们。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:433
msgid ""
"A source check reports what it can see earlier: when a module is staged, and before every build, "
"type check and test run. It parses scripts with the TypeScript parser, reads stylesheets, and "
"lists every problem at once. Files under `test/`, `tests/`, `__tests__/` or `__mocks__/`, and "
"`vitest`, `jest` or `playwright` configuration files, are exempt unless production code imports "
"them; a test helper that `client.tsx` imports is checked like any other file. Every symlink the "
"staging step would copy must resolve inside the module."
msgstr ""
"源码检查会更早报告它能发现的问题：在暂存模块时，以及每次构建、类型检查和测试运行之前。它用 TypeScript "
"解析器解析脚本，读取样式表，并一次列出所有问题。`test/`、`tests/`、`__tests__/` 或 `__mocks__/` 下的文件，以及 `vitest`、`jest` 或 "
"`playwright` 配置文件，只要生产代码没有导入它们，就不受检查；被 `client.tsx` "
"导入的测试辅助文件会像其他文件一样接受检查。暂存步骤会复制的每个符号链接都必须解析到模块内部。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:441
msgid "A module is a directory"
msgstr "模块是一个目录"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:453
msgid ""
"The host loads `styles.css`: the root layout imports it through the generated bridge on every "
"page, after the application's own stylesheet, so a module rule wins over an application rule of "
"the same specificity. A module does not import it."
msgstr "`styles.css` 由宿主加载：根布局在每个页面上通过生成的桥接文件导入它，并排在应用自身样式表之后，因此优先级相同时，模块规则会覆盖应用规则。模块不必自行导入它。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:458
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`server.ts` must exist, and may contain only `export {};`. Its two exports, `locale` and "
"`metaMessages`, are optional; see [Document language and page titles](#document-language-and-"
"page-titles)."
msgstr ""
"`server.ts` 必须存在，可以仅包含 `export {};`。它的两个导出 `locale` 和 `metaMessages` 都是可选的；参见[文档语言与页面标题"
"](#document-language-and-page-titles)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:462
msgid "`client.tsx` exports:"
msgstr "`client.tsx` 的导出项："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
