msgstr "`descriptor`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A named literal `{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`; all three values must match `site_ui_api`, `id` and "
"`locale` in the manifest."
msgstr "具名的对象字面量 `{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`；这三个值必须与清单中的 `site_ui_api`、`id` 和 `locale` 分别一致。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`Landing`"
msgstr "`Landing`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
