msgstr "`AuthFrame`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "The frame around `/login`, `/signup`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-password`, `/verify-email`."
msgstr "`/login`、`/signup`、`/forgot-password`、`/reset-password`、`/verify-email` 的外壳。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`fieldLayout`"
msgstr "`fieldLayout`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Where each account field's label, control, hint, error and action go."
msgstr "每个账号字段的标签、控件、提示、错误和操作放在哪里。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`TermsFrame`"
msgstr "`TermsFrame`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
