msgstr "`/terms` 上包裹模块法律文本的页面外壳。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`TermsContent`"
msgstr "`TermsContent`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "The module's legal text, at `/terms` and in the sign-up consent step."
msgstr "模块的法律文本，用于 `/terms` 和注册同意步骤。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`consentItems`"
msgstr "`consentItems`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What the sign-up consent step asks a visitor to confirm: a non-empty list of `{ id, label, "
"description? }`."
msgstr "注册同意步骤要求访客确认的内容：一个非空的 `{ id, label, description? }` 列表。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`authAppearance`"
msgstr "`authAppearance`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Deprecated class-map compatibility for the shared forms, supported throughout API v1."
msgstr "共享表单的类名映射兼容接口，已弃用，但在 API v1 生命周期内持续受支持。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`authMessages`"
msgstr "`authMessages`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "The deployment's wording for the account pages."
msgstr "部署的账号页面文案。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:476
msgid ""
"The host reads named exports only. A client entry with a default export fails the build, and so "
"does a second file for the same entry — `client.tsx` beside `client.js`, say — because the "
"bundler, the type checker and the test runner complete the name in different orders. The server "
"entry may keep a default export; the host does not read it."
msgstr ""
"宿主只读取具名导出。客户端入口带有默认导出会使构建失败；同一入口存在第二个文件（例如 `client.tsx` 旁边还有 "
"`client.js`）也会失败，因为打包器、类型检查器和测试工具补全文件扩展名的顺序各不相同。服务端入口可以保留默认导出，宿主不会读取它。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:482
msgid ""
"`npm run type-check` and `next build` check the exports against the contract in `contract.ts`: "
"`client.tsx` against `SiteUiClientModule`, `server.ts` against `SiteUiServerModule`. An export of"
" the wrong type fails, naming the export, and so do a partial legal set and an empty "
"`consentItems`. As the module loads, the host checks again for what a cast or an `any` hides from"
" the compiler: a component export that is not a component, a partial legal set, and "
"`consentItems` that is empty, repeats an id, or has an item without an id or a label. Any of them"
" stops the module from loading."
msgstr ""
"`npm run type-check` 和 `next build` 会按照 `contract.ts` 中的契约检查导出：`client.tsx` 对照 "
"`SiteUiClientModule`，`server.ts` 对照 `SiteUiServerModule`。类型错误的导出会导致检查失败，错误信息会指明该导出；不完整的法律条款组和空的 "
"`consentItems` 同样会失败。模块加载时，宿主会再次检查类型断言或 `any` 对编译器隐藏的问题：不是组件的组件导出、不完整的法律条款组，以及为空、id 重复或有条目缺少 id 或"
" label 的 `consentItems`。其中任何一项都会使模块无法加载。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:491
msgid ""
"**`next build` does not load the module.** Every page renders on demand, so the build evaluates "
"no client module. A mistake only the load-time check can see builds cleanly and fails on the "
"first request; from then on every page answers HTTP 500. Smoke-test each image before releasing "
"it: start it with its gateway and request `/`, the five account pages and `/terms`."
msgstr ""
"**`next build` 不会加载模块。** 每个页面都按需渲染，因此构建过程不会执行任何客户端模块。只有加载时检查才能发现的错误可以顺利通过构建，却会在第一次请求时失败；此后每个页面都返回"
" HTTP 500。发布每个镜像前都要做冒烟测试：连同网关一起启动它，并请求 `/`、五个账号页面和 `/terms`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:497
msgid ""
"**An optional export is a claim, not a gap.** `Landing: null` means \"the console's home page is "
"correct here\"; omitting `AuthFrame` means \"the account pages sit inside the console's "
"container\". A module that exports neither is a module that replaced nothing, and that is a "
"legitimate thing to be while it is being written."
msgstr ""
"**可选导出表达的是意图，不是遗漏。** `Landing: null` 表示“这里使用控制台首页”；不提供 `AuthFrame` "
"表示“账号页面放在控制台容器中”。两者都不导出的模块没有替换任何页面，这可以是模块开发过程中的合理状态。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:503
msgid ""
"**A frame that exists owns the whole page.** `AuthFrame` and `TermsFrame` render their own "
"header, `<main>` and footer, because supplying one is a claim to draw the page. A frame that "
"draws only a card leaves five pages with no chrome — that is not a styling choice the host can "
"correct, so it is the first thing to get right."
msgstr ""
"**提供外壳就代表负责整张页面。** `AuthFrame` 和 `TermsFrame` 需要绘制自己的页头、`<main>` "
"与页脚，因为提供它们就意味着接管页面。如果外壳只绘制一张卡片，五个页面就会失去外层框架。宿主无法替模块纠正这种布局选择，因此首先要确保这一点。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:509
msgid ""
"`AuthFrame` must render the supplied shared form `children` and preserve any provided `topbar` "
"and `legal` nodes. Its headings and page identifier let one frame serve the five account routes. "
"It supplies the complete outer page, so the host does not add another header or footer around it."
msgstr ""
"`AuthFrame` 必须渲染提供的共享表单 `children`，并保留任何传入的 `topbar` 和 `legal` "
"节点。标题和页面标识让同一个外壳能够服务五个账号路由。它负责完整的外层页面，因此宿主不会再在它外面添加页头或页脚。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:514
msgid ""
"**The legal set is one decision.** A module that publishes its own terms exports `TermsFrame`, "
"`TermsContent` and `consentItems` together; one that exports none of them keeps the console's "
"terms and its four confirmations. The host renders `TermsContent` in both places a visitor meets "
"the terms: at `/terms`, as the `children` of `TermsFrame`, and in the sign-up consent step, where"
" the module's `consentItems` replace the console's confirmations. The text a visitor accepts is "
"the text the site publishes."
msgstr ""
"**法律条款组是一个整体决定。** 发布自有条款的模块要同时导出 `TermsFrame`、`TermsContent` 和 "
"`consentItems`；三者都不导出的模块沿用控制台的条款及其四个确认项。宿主会在访客看到条款的两个地方渲染 `TermsContent`：在 `/terms` 上作为 "
"`TermsFrame` 的 `children`；在注册同意步骤中，由模块的 `consentItems` 替换控制台的确认项。访客接受的文本就是站点发布的文本。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:522
msgid ""
"`TermsContent` renders the legal body only — its sections and any preamble such as a date; the "
"page heading is the frame's. It receives `headingLevel` 2 and `compact` false at `/terms`, and "
"`headingLevel` 3 and `compact` true in the consent step's scrolling box. `TermsFrame` draws the "
"page around it and must render its `children`. At `/terms`, give each section its `terms-s` "
"anchor: the account pages link privacy to `/terms#terms-s5`. Setting manifest file paths does not"
" substitute a legal document here."
msgstr ""
"`TermsContent` 只渲染法律正文，即各章节以及日期之类的前言；页面标题由外壳负责。在 `/terms` 上，它收到的 `headingLevel` 为 2、`compact` 为 "
"false；在注册同意步骤的滚动框中，`headingLevel` 为 3、`compact` 为 true。`TermsFrame` 负责绘制包裹它的页面，并且必须渲染其 "
"`children`。在 `/terms` 上，请为每个章节设置 `terms-s` 锚点：账号页面的隐私链接指向 "
"`/terms#terms-s5`。设置清单中的文件路径不能替代这里的法律文档。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:530
msgid ""
"Declare `consentItems` with the `ConsentItems` type, and give each item a unique `id`. A plain "
"`ConsentItem[]` fails the type check, because it does not promise at least one item. Every item "
"unlocks once the visitor has read the terms to the end, and Continue waits for all of them. The "
"backend records a single `accepted_tos` flag, which the sign-up request sends only after every "
"item has been checked."
msgstr ""
"请用 `ConsentItems` 类型声明 `consentItems`，并为每个条目设置唯一的 `id`。普通的 `ConsentItem[]` "
"无法通过类型检查，因为它不能保证至少有一个条目。访客把条款读到末尾后，每个条目才会解锁；Continue 按钮要等所有条目都勾选后才可用。后端只记录一个 `accepted_tos` "
"标志，注册请求只有在每个条目都勾选之后才会发送它。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:537
msgid ""
"`authMessages` changes wording, not validation or the required field set. The host keeps only the"
" keys `AUTH_MESSAGE_KEYS` declares, with string values, and drops everything else before a page "
"reads it, so wording for a console page — `auth.authorize.*` for `/authorize`, `chat.*` for "
"`/chat` — has no effect. Missing keys retain the shared defaults. Preserve each message's "
"interpolation variables. A module may localize its own pages and supported keys, but this does "
"not translate every console page."
msgstr ""
"`authMessages` 修改文案，不改变校验规则或必填字段集合。宿主只保留 `AUTH_MESSAGE_KEYS` "
"声明的键及其字符串值，并在页面读取之前丢弃其余内容，因此针对控制台页面的文案（`/authorize` 的 `auth.authorize.*`、`/chat` 的 "
"`chat.*`）不会生效。缺失的键继续使用共享默认值。请保留每条消息的插值变量。模块可以本地化自己的页面和受支持的消息键，但这不会翻译所有控制台页面。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:545
msgid "Document language and page titles"
msgstr "文档语言与页面标题"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:547
msgid ""
"The server entry's optional `locale` sets `<html lang>` on the routes the module renders: `/` "
"when it exports `Landing`, the five account pages when it exports `AuthFrame`, and `/terms` when "
"it exports the legal set. Every other route — the console, and a public route whose export the "
"module leaves out — is the console's, in `en`. An empty or omitted `locale` keeps `en` "
"everywhere. The attribute follows client-side navigation as well as the first response."
msgstr ""
"服务端入口中可选的 `locale` 设置模块所渲染路由的 `<html lang>`：导出 `Landing` 时为 `/`，导出 `AuthFrame` 时为五个账号页面，导出法律条款组时为"
" `/terms`。其余路由（控制台，以及模块未提供相应导出的公开路由）都属于控制台，使用 `en`。`locale` 为空或省略时，所有路由都保持 "
"`en`。该属性既体现在首次响应中，也会随客户端导航更新。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:554
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The optional `metaMessages` words the titles and descriptions of the seven public routes. Its "
"keys are `meta.<page>.title` and `meta.<page>.description`, where `<page>` is `home`, `login`, "
"`signup`, `forgot`, `reset`, `verify` or `terms`; `META_MESSAGE_KEYS` in `contract.ts` lists "
"them. The host filters it the way it filters `authMessages`, dropping undeclared keys and values "
"that are not strings. `meta.home.title` is the whole document title; every other title is shown "
"as `<title> | <site name>`, as on the console's own pages. Each value may use `{app_name}`."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `metaMessages` 为七个公开路由提供标题和描述文案。它的键是 `meta.<page>.title` 和 `meta.<page>.description`，其中 "
"`<page>` 为 `home`、`login`、`signup`、`forgot`、`reset`、`verify` 或 `terms`；`contract.ts` 中的 "
"`META_MESSAGE_KEYS` 列出了全部键。宿主会像过滤 `authMessages` 一样过滤它，丢弃未声明的键和非字符串值。`meta.home.title` "
"是完整的文档标题；其他标题显示为 `<title> | <site name>`，与控制台自身页面一致。每个值都可以使用 `{app_name}`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:563
msgid ""
"A page the module does not word keeps its default: the site's title and description, or \"Terms "
"of Service\" for `/terms`. Titles do not depend on which routes the module renders. Console pages"
" keep their English titles, and icons come from runtime branding."
msgstr "模块未提供文案的页面保留默认值：站点自身的标题和描述，`/terms` 则为“Terms of Service”。标题与模块渲染哪些路由无关。控制台页面保留英文标题，图标来自运行时品牌配置。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:568
msgid "Building an image with a module"
msgstr "使用模块构建镜像"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:570
msgid "The official frontend Dockerfile takes the module as a Buildx named context:"
msgstr "官方前端 Dockerfile 通过 Buildx 命名上下文接收模块："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`site-ui` context"
msgstr "`site-ui` 上下文"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the built-in marker"
msgstr "内置标记"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "no external module; the neutral UI"
msgstr "没有外部模块，使用默认 UI"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`.`"
msgstr "`.`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the module's directory inside the context"
msgstr "上下文中的模块目录"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`SITE_UI_API`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_API`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "required with an external module; must be `1`"
msgstr "使用外部模块时必填，必须为 `1`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:596
msgid ""
"A distribution may pass its whole `frontend/` tree as the context and select the module with "
"`SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui`. This keeps the module and its related build inputs under one pinned "
"source tree."
msgstr "发行版可以将整个 `frontend/` 树作为上下文，并通过 `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui` 选择模块。这样，模块及其相关构建输入都包含在同一个固定版本的源码树中。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:600
msgid ""
"An external context that carries no module **fails the build**. Falling back to the neutral UI "
"would publish a site whose home page reverted, and nothing in the build log would say so."
msgstr "外部上下文未包含模块时，**构建会失败**。不能悄悄回退到默认 UI，否则发布的首页会变回控制台页面，构建日志却毫无提示。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:604
msgid ""
"The reverse fails too. `SITE_UI_API`, or a `SITE_UI_SUBDIR` other than `.`, given without "
"`--build-context site-ui=...` stops the build with a message that names the missing context, "
"rather than building the neutral UI in the module's place."
msgstr ""
"反过来也会失败：没有提供 `--build-context site-ui=...`，却设置了 `SITE_UI_API` 或不等于 `.` 的 "
"`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`，构建会停止并报错指出缺少的上下文，而不是用默认 UI 顶替模块。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:609
msgid "Local development"
msgstr "本地开发"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:611
msgid ""
"The same staging step runs on a workstation, without Docker. Run a gateway first and set "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` to its address if it is not `http://backend:8080`; the existing runtime "
"`/site-config` dependency is unchanged:"
msgstr ""
"同一暂存步骤也可在工作站运行，无需 Docker。请先启动网关；若地址不是 `http://backend:8080`，则设置 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`。应用对运行时 "
"`/site-config` 的依赖保持不变："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:625
msgid ""
"Staging empties `--into` before it copies the module in, so `--into` must be a directory of its "
"own: it may not overlap `--context`, and may not be or contain `--app`."
msgstr "暂存步骤会先清空 `--into` 再复制模块，因此 `--into` 必须是一个独立目录：不能与 `--context` 重叠，也不能等于或包含 `--app`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:629
msgid "`SITE_UI_DIR` and `SITE_UI_API` name the module directly if you would rather not stage a copy:"
msgstr "如果不想暂存副本，可以用 `SITE_UI_DIR` 和 `SITE_UI_API` 直接指定模块："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:637
msgid ""
"A relative `SITE_UI_DIR` resolves against `apps/frontend`, whichever directory the command runs "
"from. Tailwind scans the selected module's directory as well as `src/`, so a utility class that "
"only a module outside `src/` uses is still generated."
msgstr ""
"相对路径形式的 `SITE_UI_DIR` 总是相对于 `apps/frontend` 解析，与命令在哪个目录运行无关。Tailwind 除了扫描 `src/`，还会扫描所选模块的目录，因此只被"
" `src/` 之外的模块使用的工具类也会生成。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:642
msgid ""
"The variables above apply to that one command; no shell profile is changed. To return to the "
"neutral UI, stop the server and run:"
msgstr "上述变量仅作用于当前命令，不会修改 shell 配置。若要恢复默认 UI，停止服务器后执行："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:649
msgid ""
"Local dev serves module assets via `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`; the image recipe packages them "
"automatically."
msgstr "本地开发通过 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 提供模块资源；镜像配方会自动打包这些资源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:652
msgid ""
"The staging environment file is used by the Dockerfile, not automatically read by npm. Leaving a "
"staged directory behind does not select it for later commands."
msgstr "暂存环境文件由 Dockerfile 使用，npm 不会自动读取。保留暂存目录不会让之后的命令自动选择该模块。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:655
msgid ""
"Either way the resolver writes `src/site-ui/active/` and `tsconfig.generated.json`, so the "
"bundler, the type checker and the test runner all read the same decision. Those files are "
"generated; do not edit them."
msgstr ""
"无论采用哪种方式，解析器都会写出 `src/site-ui/active/` 与 "
"`tsconfig.generated.json`，让打包器、类型检查器和测试工具使用同一选择。这些文件由工具生成，请勿手工编辑。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:659
msgid ""
"`npm run type-check` and `next build` both type-check against `tsconfig.generated.json`. It "
"reaches a module's production code through the entries' imports and leaves the module's directory"
" out of its file globs, and the application does not lint a module at all. A module's tests and "
"tooling are for the distribution's own repository to check. A declaration file that nothing "
"imports, such as one holding an ambient `declare module`, is outside that import graph too: "
"reference it from an entry with `/// <reference path=\"./types.d.ts\" />`."
msgstr ""
"`npm run type-check` 和 `next build` 都使用 `tsconfig.generated.json` "
"做类型检查。它通过入口的导入关系覆盖模块的生产代码，并把模块目录排除在文件匹配范围之外；应用也完全不会对模块执行 "
"lint。模块的测试和工具链应由发行版自己的仓库负责检查。没有被任何文件导入的声明文件（例如包含环境声明 `declare module` 的文件）同样不在该导入图中：请在入口中用 `/// "
"<reference path=\"./types.d.ts\" />` 引用它。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:667
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "资源"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:669
msgid ""
"A module's images live in `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`. The image build packages them in "
"`site-assets/<module-id>/` beside the standalone server rather than in `public/`: Next.js serves "
"`public/` before any route, and a file there would bypass the `/site-assets` route. Three rules, "
"all enforced:"
msgstr ""
"模块图片位于 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`。镜像构建会把它们打包到独立服务器旁边的 `site-assets/<module-id>/`，而不是 "
"`public/`：Next.js 会在任何路由之前先提供 `public/` 中的文件，放在那里的文件会绕过 `/site-assets` 路由。以下三条规则均由工具强制执行："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:674
msgid ""
"**Under the module's own id.** An asset elsewhere fails the build. This is what makes \"two "
"modules cannot write the same path, and neither can shadow the application's\" true."
msgstr "**资源必须位于模块自身 id 下。** 放在其他路径会使构建失败，从而保证不同模块不能写入同一路径，也不能覆盖应用资源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:677
msgid ""
"**Never a collision.** A module asset at a path the application already ships fails the build "
"rather than overwriting it."
msgstr "**不允许冲突。** 模块资源与应用已有路径冲突时构建失败，不会静默覆盖。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:679
msgid ""
"**The route is what serves them.** `/site-assets/*` serves image files only — AVIF, GIF, ICO, "
"JPEG, PNG, SVG and WebP, up to 20 MB — with a five-minute revalidating cache policy and "
"`nosniff`, and sandboxes an SVG with a `Content-Security-Policy` header. A bundle with anything "
"under `public/site-assets/<module-id>/` fails the build. Test the URL, not the file."
msgstr ""
"**资源由路由提供。** `/site-assets/*` 只提供图片文件（AVIF、GIF、ICO、JPEG、PNG、SVG 和 WebP，最大 20 MB），附带五分钟的重新验证缓存策略和 "
"`nosniff`，并通过 `Content-Security-Policy` 头把 SVG 放进沙箱。构建产物的 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/` "
"下只要有任何内容，构建就会失败。请测试 URL，而不是只看文件是否存在。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:685
msgid ""
"At runtime, `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` is read first and the image's own copy second. A deployment that "
"mounts its branding directory keeps overriding the module's files, and one that mounts nothing "
"still serves a complete site."
msgstr "运行时先读取 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR`，再回退到镜像内的副本。挂载品牌目录的部署可以继续覆盖模块资源；未挂载目录的部署也有完整站点。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:689
msgid ""
"The override works file by file, and `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` must be an absolute path. The build copies"
" a relative symlink as the link it is, with its target unchanged, so a link that stays inside the"
" module keeps working in the image. The route does not serve a link whose target is outside its "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"覆盖按文件逐个生效，且 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` "
"必须是绝对路径。构建会把相对符号链接原样复制为链接，目标保持不变，因此留在模块内部的链接在镜像中仍然有效。目标位于所在目录之外的链接，路由不会提供。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:694
msgid "Styling the shared forms"
msgstr "共享表单样式"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:696
msgid ""
"The shared account forms render their own markup and default styling. Stable semantic hooks "
"provide styles and state; the `fieldLayout` export provides structural variation. The deprecated "
"class map remains supported throughout API v1."
msgstr "共享账号表单负责自己的标记结构和默认样式。稳定的语义属性提供样式与状态接口，`fieldLayout` 导出支持结构差异。已弃用的类名映射在整个 API v1 生命周期内仍受支持。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:701
msgid "**`data-auth` attributes for styling and state.** Shared form elements expose:"
msgstr "**用于样式与状态的 `data-auth` 属性。** 共享表单元素提供："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "On"
msgstr "所在元素"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"form\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"form\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the body of an account page: its `<form>`, or the box a result or the sign-up consent step sits in"
msgstr "账号页面的主体：其 `<form>` 元素，或承载结果、注册同意步骤的容器"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"field\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "each field's wrapper"
msgstr "每个字段的外层元素"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the label, and each input or textarea"
msgstr "标签，以及每个输入框或文本域"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the hint and the error paragraph"
msgstr "提示与错误段落"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "an info, error or success notice; a button inside one is `[data-auth=\"notice\"] button`"
msgstr "信息、错误或成功提示；提示内的按钮可用 `[data-auth=\"notice\"] button` 选中"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"submit\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"submit\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the page's primary button, or the link that stands in for it"
msgstr "页面的主按钮，或代替主按钮的链接"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"field-action\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field-action\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the wrapper around a field's own action, such as the forgot-password link"
msgstr "字段自身操作（如忘记密码链接）的外层元素"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"secondary-actions\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"secondary-actions\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the row of alternative links on `/verify-email`"
msgstr "`/verify-email` 上的备选链接行"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "each sign-up confirmation: the label holding its checkbox and sentence"
msgstr "每个注册确认项：包含复选框及其说明文字的标签"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent-section\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent-section\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "each section of the sign-up consent step"
msgstr "注册同意步骤中的每个分区"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "the resolving-session region"
msgstr "会话解析中的区域"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:717
msgid ""
"State is carried by the attributes the application already sets — `aria-invalid`, `disabled`, "
"`aria-busy`, `data-auth-error`, `data-auth-tone` — so a stylesheet never has to infer \"this "
"field is in error\" from a class name. The set is part of the contract: an attribute is added, "
"never repurposed."
msgstr ""
"状态由应用设置的现有属性表达，包括 `aria-invalid`、`disabled`、`aria-busy`、`data-auth-error` 和 `data-auth-"
"tone`。样式表无需根据类名猜测字段是否出错。这组属性属于契约：可以新增，但不能改变已有属性的含义。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:722
msgid ""
"The host describes each control itself. Before a `fieldLayout` sees the control, `AuthField` "
"gives it `aria-describedby` naming the field's hint (`<id>-hint`) and error (`<id>-error`), kept "
"alongside any value the page set, and `aria-invalid=\"true\"` while the error shows."
msgstr ""
"控件的描述关联由宿主自己设置。在 `fieldLayout` 拿到控件之前，`AuthField` 会为它设置 `aria-"
"describedby`，指向字段的提示（`<id>-hint`）和错误（`<id>-error`），并保留页面原本设置的值；错误显示期间还会设置 `aria-"
"invalid=\"true\"`。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:727
msgid ""
"**Field layout.** The optional `fieldLayout` export receives the shared control, hint, error and "
"action nodes, and the label's text and `htmlFor` id. It must render every supplied node, "
"associate the label with that id, and preserve the `data-auth=\"field\"` and `data-"
"auth=\"label\"` hooks. The control arrives already described, so the relationship survives any "
"arrangement that renders every node. The neutral layout places the field action after the control"
" and validation; a module may place it beside its label. `fieldLayout` is a supported export in "
"its own right, not part of the deprecated class map."
msgstr ""
"**字段布局。** 可选的 `fieldLayout` 导出接收共享控件、提示、错误与操作节点，以及标签文本和 `htmlFor` id。它必须渲染所有传入节点，将标签关联到该 id，并保留 "
"`data-auth=\"field\"` 和 `data-auth=\"label\"` "
"属性。控件传入时已经带有描述关联，因此只要每个节点都被渲染，无论如何排列，这种关联都会保留。默认布局将字段操作放在控件与验证信息之后；模块可以将其放在标签旁边。`fieldLayout` "
"本身就是受支持的独立导出，不属于已弃用的类名映射。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:736
msgid ""
"**Deprecated `authAppearance` class map.** The class-map export remains a supported compatibility"
" surface throughout API v1; it holds class names only. New styling should prefer scoped `data-"
"auth` and state selectors; class names are module-owned details. The semantic-style migration is "
"not complete. Removing this adapter requires the next API revision, a documented migration and "
"comparison of normal, invalid, loading and keyboard states. Deprecation does not allow breaking "
"existing v1 modules."
msgstr ""
"**已弃用的 `authAppearance` 类名映射。** 此类名映射导出在整个 API v1 生命周期内仍是受支持的兼容接口，只包含类名。新样式应优先使用限定作用域的 `data-"
"auth` 和状态选择器；类名是模块自己的实现细节。语义样式迁移尚未完成。移除此适配层必须发布下一版 API、提供迁移文档，并对比正常、无效、加载和键盘操作状态。弃用并不意味着可以破坏现有 v1"
" 模块。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:744
msgid ""
"All customization is subject to the same rule: **the module's CSS may only affect the pages it "
"owns.** A stylesheet that reaches `body`, `:root` or a bare element selector will restyle the "
"console too, and no check will catch it for you — scope everything under a root class the module "
"sets on its own shell."
msgstr ""
"所有定制都遵循同一条规则：**模块 CSS 只能影响模块负责的页面。** 选择 `body`、`:root` "
"或裸元素的样式会同时改变控制台，目前没有检查器替你拦截。应将所有规则限定在模块外壳设置的根类名之下。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:749
msgid "When a module component fails"
msgstr "模块组件出错时"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:751
msgid ""
"A module component that throws — `Landing`, `AuthFrame`, `fieldLayout`, `TermsFrame` or "
"`TermsContent` — takes down its own page and nothing else. Each renders inside its page, and the "
"application's route error page (`app/error.tsx`) replaces that page with a neutral message and a "
"Try again button. On a route whose chrome the module draws, the message comes with the console's "
"header and footer. It never falls back to the console's terms or confirmations when the module's "
"fail to render. A console page's own render error is shown the same way, inside the console "
"chrome."
msgstr ""
"抛出异常的模块组件（`Landing`、`AuthFrame`、`fieldLayout`、`TermsFrame` 或 "
"`TermsContent`）只会影响它自己所在的页面。每个组件都在各自页面内渲染，应用的路由错误页（`app/error.tsx`）会用一条中性的提示信息和一个 Try again "
"按钮替换该页面。如果该路由的外层框架由模块绘制，提示信息会带上控制台的页头和页脚。模块的条款或确认项渲染失败时，错误页绝不会改用控制台的条款或确认项。控制台页面自身的渲染错误也以同样方式显示在控制台外层框架内。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:760
msgid ""
"React renders no error boundary on the server, so the first response for a failing page is still "
"an error: HTTP 500, or HTTP 200 with a loading state on the account pages that render inside "
"`<Suspense>` (`/login`, `/reset-password` and `/verify-email`). The browser then renders the page"
" again and shows the message. A status code alone does not show that a page works."
msgstr ""
"React 在服务器端不会渲染错误边界，因此出错页面的首次响应仍然是错误：HTTP 500；对于在 `<Suspense>` 内渲染的账号页面（`/login`、`/reset-"
"password` 和 `/verify-email`），则是带加载状态的 HTTP 200。随后浏览器会重新渲染页面并显示提示信息。仅凭状态码无法证明页面正常。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:766
msgid ""
"A module that fails its load-time check is different: the root layout loads the module, so every "
"page fails with it."
msgstr "未通过加载时检查的模块则不同：根布局会加载模块，因此每个页面都会随之失败。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:769
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:771
msgid ""
"**Adding a module does not change the console.** The five account pages sit in the console "
"container when no `AuthFrame` is exported, and the shared pages, schemas and session handling are"
" untouched either way."
msgstr "**添加模块不会改变控制台。** 未导出 `AuthFrame` 时，五个账号页面留在控制台容器中；无论是否提供模块，共享页面、数据结构与会话处理都保持不变。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:774
msgid ""
"**Removing an optional export is safe.** A module that stops exporting `Landing` gets the "
"console's home page back."
msgstr "**移除可选导出是安全的。** 模块停止导出 `Landing` 后，将恢复控制台首页。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:776
msgid ""
"**The legal set is removed whole.** Dropping all three exports brings back the console's terms "
"and confirmations; dropping one of them fails the type check."
msgstr "**法律条款组只能整体移除。** 同时去掉三个导出会恢复控制台的条款和确认项；只去掉其中一个会导致类型检查失败。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:778
msgid ""
"**Renaming or removing an export, changing a prop's meaning, or repurposing a `data-auth` value "
"is a breaking change** and belongs behind an API revision bump. So does renaming a key in "
"`authMessages` or `metaMessages`, or changing its interpolation variables."
msgstr ""
"**重命名或删除导出、改变属性含义，或改变 `data-auth` 值的用途，均属于破坏性变更**，需要提升 API 版本。重命名 `authMessages` 或 `metaMessages`"
" 中的键，或改变其插值变量，也一样。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:782
msgid "**Adding an optional key or attribute is compatible.**"
msgstr "**新增可选键或属性是兼容变更。**"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:784
msgid ""
"`SITE_UI_API` selects the Site UI interface revision. The resolver refuses a module that declares"
" a revision this checkout does not implement, rather than building something neither side was "
"written for."
msgstr "`SITE_UI_API` 用于选择 Site UI 接口版本。如果模块声明的版本不是当前源码支持的版本，解析器会拒绝构建，避免产出双方都不支持的组合。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:788
msgid ""
"The module API has no shared public-layout export; a module organizes its own internal layouts "
"freely."
msgstr "模块 API 不提供共享公开布局导出；模块可以自由组织自己的内部布局。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:791
msgid "Testing a module"
msgstr "测试模块"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:793
msgid ""
"The shared repository owns validation and the image recipe. These checks use the built-in neutral"
" module and the public example."
msgstr "共享仓库负责校验和镜像构建配方。这些检查使用内置中立模块和公开示例。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:803
msgid ""
"When checking your own module, pass the same module selection variables used for local "
"development. Exercise normal, invalid, loading and keyboard states of the shared forms, every "
"public page your module supplies, and the console to check for style leakage."
msgstr "检查自己的模块时，传入与本地开发相同的模块选择变量。测试共享表单的正常、无效、加载和键盘操作状态，以及模块提供的每个公开页面，并检查控制台是否受到模块样式影响。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:808
msgid ""
"Then smoke-test the built image: start it with a gateway, since every page reads `/site-config`, "
"and request `/`, the five account pages and `/terms`. `next build` does not load the module, so "
"this is the first point at which its load-time check runs."
msgstr ""
"然后对构建出的镜像做冒烟测试：由于每个页面都会读取 `/site-config`，请连同网关一起启动它，并请求 `/`、五个账号页面和 `/terms`。`next build` "
"不会加载模块，因此这是模块加载时检查第一次运行的时机。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:813
msgid ""
"From the repository root, build the neutral image and the public example through the same "
"upstream recipe:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录使用同一份上游配方构建默认镜像与公开示例："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:826
msgid ""
"The first manifest must report `kind: \"neutral\"`; the second must report `id: \"example\"`. "
"These image builds need Docker and network access for dependencies. Serving the full application "
"also needs the gateway's runtime `/site-config` endpoint."
msgstr ""
"第一个清单必须报告 `kind: \"neutral\"`，第二个必须报告 `id: \"example\"`。这些构建需要 Docker 以及下载依赖的网络连接。完整应用运行时还需要网关提供 "
"`/site-config` 端点。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:831
msgid ""
"The **Site UI Containers** CI job builds these two shapes and checks their manifests. It also "
"requires a build given `SITE_UI_API` and `SITE_UI_SUBDIR` but no `site-ui` context to fail. It "
"then starts the example image with a `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` that holds a replacement for the example's"
" mark. The replacement must be served, and once it is removed the packaged mark must come back "
"through the route, with its SVG sandbox and cache policy. The job runs whenever the CI change "
"classifier sets `site_ui` — for a change to any frontend input, `.dockerignore`, `deploy/docker"
"/site-ui/` or `distributions/example/` — and the CI gate then requires it to pass."
msgstr ""
"**Site UI Containers** CI 任务会构建这两种镜像并检查它们的清单。它还要求：设置了 `SITE_UI_API` 和 `SITE_UI_SUBDIR` 却没有 `site-"
"ui` 上下文的构建必须失败。随后它启动示例镜像，并在 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` "
"中放一个替换示例标志图的文件。该替换文件必须被提供；删除它之后，打包的标志图必须重新通过路由提供，并带有 SVG 沙箱和缓存策略。只要 CI 变更分类器设置了 "
"`site_ui`（即任何前端输入、`.dockerignore`、`deploy/docker/site-ui/` 或 `distributions/example/` "
"发生变更），该任务就会运行，CI 门禁也会要求它通过。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:841
msgid ""
"Build and test the distribution's own image and assets as well. An upstream example passing does "
"not validate a privately maintained module."
msgstr "还需构建并测试发行版自己的镜像和资源。上游示例通过，并不能验证私有维护的模块。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:846
msgid "4. Backend extensions"
msgstr "4\\. 后端扩展"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:848
msgid ""
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` is an optional comma-delimited list of trusted, local Python module names. "
"It is empty by default. Each module must expose a synchronous `register()` function that takes no"
" arguments. The gateway imports and registers each module once per process, after loading dotenv "
"and before constructing runtime routes or consuming their registries. An import or registration "
"failure aborts startup; the gateway does not silently use a different adapter."
msgstr ""
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 是可选的、以逗号分隔的受信任本地 Python 模块名列表，默认值为空。每个模块必须提供同步、无参数的 `register()` 函数。网关加载 "
"dotenv 后、构造运行时路由或使用相关注册表前，在每个进程中导入并注册每个模块一次。导入或注册失败会中止启动；网关不会悄悄换用其他适配器。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:855
msgid ""
"Extensions register factories through `serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, "
"factory, *, override=False)`. A factory receives a configuration dictionary and returns an "
"adapter, before built-in provider defaults are applied. Registering an existing extension kind is"
" an error. Replacing a built-in kind requires `override=True` and emits a log entry. Registered "
"kinds also become reserved provider labels. The startup `register()` function may populate the "
"existing runtime-setting and provider metadata dictionaries before their consumers run; it must "
"mutate those shared dictionaries rather than replace them."
msgstr ""
"扩展通过 `serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *, override=False)` "
"注册工厂。工厂在内置 provider 默认值应用前接收配置字典并返回适配器。注册已存在的扩展 kind 会报错。替换内置 kind 必须设置 "
"`override=True`，且会记录日志。注册的 kind 也会成为保留的 provider 标签。启动时的 `register()` 函数可在使用方运行前，填充现有的运行时设置和 "
"provider 元数据字典；必须修改这些共享字典，而不能替换它们。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:865
msgid ""
"The deployment must make these modules importable, for example through its read-only overlay "
"mount. This executes trusted server code, not user-supplied configuration: do not derive module "
"names from requests or allow an admin form to choose them. The loader does not fetch remote "
"modules or load code per request. Import all extension code during startup, avoid later lazy "
"imports or live code reloads, and restart the backend when changing the mounted extension. See "
"[Deployment-local adapters](adding-models.md#deployment-local-adapters) for a minimal factory "
"example."
msgstr ""
"部署必须确保这些模块可导入，例如通过只读 overlay "
"挂载提供模块。这里执行的是受信任的服务端代码，不是用户提交的配置：不要从请求推导模块名，也不要允许管理表单选择模块。加载器不会获取远程模块，也不会逐请求加载代码。请在启动阶段导入全部扩展代码，避免之后的延迟导入或代码热重载，并在修改挂载的扩展后重启后端。最小工厂示例见[部署本地适配器"
"](adding-models.md#deployment-local-adapters)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:874
msgid "Cloud Agent access"
msgstr "云端 Agent 访问权限"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:876
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps its fixed role hierarchy and resolves current account state. The deployment "
"owns the rule for who can use or administer its Cloud Agent. A trusted extension registers one "
"synchronous callback during `register()` with "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)`. The callback receives a read-only "
"mapping containing exactly `user_id` and `role`, after the gateway has verified that the user "
"exists and has status `active`. It receives no profile, credentials, or database connection."
msgstr ""
"网关保留固定的角色层级，并解析账户当前状态。由部署定义谁可以使用或管理其云端 Agent。受信任的扩展在 `register()` 中通过 "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)` 注册一个同步回调。网关先确认用户存在且状态为 "
"`active`，再向回调传入仅包含 `user_id` 和 `role` 的只读映射。回调不会收到用户资料、凭据或数据库连接。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:884
msgid ""
"The callback returns a `list[str]` or `tuple[str, ...]` of explicit permissions: `agent.use` "
"permits Agent use, and `agent.admin` permits Agent administration. Administration requires both "
"permissions. Unknown, repeated, or non-string permissions are invalid; values are not coerced. "
"Registering a second policy is an error. With no registered policy, Agent access is denied for "
"every role. The gateway imposes no deployment-specific role-to-permission rule."
msgstr ""
"回调以 `list[str]` 或 `tuple[str, ...]` 返回显式权限：`agent.use` 允许使用 Agent，`agent.admin` 允许管理 "
"Agent。管理操作需要同时具备这两项权限。未知、重复或非字符串权限均无效，框架不会强制转换取值。注册第二个策略会报错。没有注册策略时，所有角色都无权访问 "
"Agent。网关不规定特定部署的角色与权限映射规则。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:891
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The standalone Agent reads `GET /internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access` using the existing "
"`GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token. A successful response contains exactly `user_id`, "
"`allowed`, and `permissions`; `allowed` is true exactly when `agent.use` is present. Permissions "
"are returned in the order `agent.use`, `agent.admin`. An intentional denial is HTTP 200 with "
"`allowed: false` and `permissions: []`. The endpoint reads the gateway's operational store and "
"evaluates the policy on each request; it does not cache permission decisions. Account reads "
"retain the existing user-cache semantics: `CachedOperationalStore` caches user rows for 60 "
"seconds, and account changes through that wrapper invalidate the affected entry. Direct database "
"edits or writes in another process may remain unseen until that cache entry expires."
msgstr ""
"独立 Agent 使用现有的 `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token 调用 `GET /internal/users/{user_id"
"}/agent-access`。成功响应仅包含 `user_id`、`allowed` 和 `permissions`；只有包含 `agent.use` 时，`allowed` 才为 "
"true。权限按 `agent.use`、`agent.admin` 的顺序返回。策略明确拒绝访问时返回 HTTP 200，内容为 `allowed: false` 和 "
"`permissions: []`。端点在每次请求时读取网关的 operational store "
"并评估策略，不缓存权限判定结果。账户读取保留现有的用户缓存语义：`CachedOperationalStore` 将用户行缓存 60 "
"秒，通过该包装层修改账户会使对应缓存项失效。直接修改数据库或由其他进程写入的变更，可能要等到缓存项过期后才会被读取到。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:903
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Unknown or inactive accounts receive HTTP 403 with error type `subject_unavailable`, before the "
"callback runs. A callback exception or invalid result receives HTTP 503 with error type "
"`agent_access_unavailable`, without policy details. Both use the gateway's standard `{\"error\": "
"{\"type\": ..., \"message\": ...}}` envelope. Dispatch authentication and unavailable internal "
"API configuration retain their existing 401 and 404 responses. The legacy user-status and model-"
"catalog endpoints retain their existing contracts."
msgstr ""
"账户不存在或未处于 active 状态时，在调用回调前返回 HTTP 403，错误类型为 `subject_unavailable`。回调抛出异常或返回无效结果时，返回 HTTP "
"503，错误类型为 `agent_access_unavailable`，不包含策略细节。两者都使用网关标准的 `{\"error\": {\"type\": ..., \"message\":"
" ...}}` 响应结构。Dispatch 鉴权失败和内部 API 未配置时，仍分别返回现有的 401 和 404 响应。旧 user-status 和 model-catalog "
"端点保留原有契约。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:911
msgid "Quota reporting"
msgstr "配额报告"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:913
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps quota reporting and quota-aware routing independent of the service that "
"measures usage. The public framework supplies the Providers tab's result rows, disabled-key "
"cards, key discovery and `gather_all`, plus RouteWise's quota snapshots. No quota source is "
"enabled by default. A trusted backend extension connects an authorized usage API or the "
"operator's own metering service; the framework does not require a particular supplier, website "
"login or cookie."
msgstr ""
"网关将配额报告和配额感知路由与用量计量服务解耦。公共框架提供 Providers 标签页的结果行、禁用密钥卡片、密钥发现和 `gather_all`，以及 RouteWise "
"的配额快照。默认不启用任何配额来源。受信任的后端扩展负责接入已授权的用量 API 或运营者自己的计量服务；框架不要求特定供应商、网页登录或 cookie。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:921
msgid ""
"An extension's `register()` calls `serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider,"
" display_name, fetch)`; `fetch` is awaited as `fetch(operational_store, services)` and returns "
"one `ProviderQuotaResult` per configured key, converting its own failures into results rather "
"than raising. The admin endpoint supplies the store and services; RouteWise currently calls it "
"with `(None, None)`, so the fetcher must also work without those objects. Registration runs at "
"startup, not when the module is merely imported. A fetcher queries usage; it does not send user "
"inference requests or change the route's inference protocol."
msgstr ""
"扩展的 `register()` 调用 `serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, display_name,"
" fetch)`；框架通过 `fetch(operational_store, services)` 等待 `fetch` 完成，每个已配置密钥返回一个 "
"`ProviderQuotaResult`，并将失败转换成结果而不是抛出异常。管理端点会提供存储和服务对象；RouteWise 目前传入 `(None, "
"None)`，因此抓取器也必须能在没有这些对象的情况下工作。注册发生在启动阶段，而不是仅导入模块时。抓取器查询用量，不负责发送用户推理请求，也不改变路由的推理协议。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:931
msgid ""
"Each result contains `ProviderQuotaUsage` rows with `label`, `used`, `limit`, `unit` and an "
"optional timezone-aware `reset_at`. The deployment's provider identifier links the source to its "
"routes; it is not a hard-coded vendor enum. `quota_source.provider`, `usage_label` and `unit` "
"must exactly match a returned result and usage row. Report the account/window shared by that "
"quota pool, and keep independent accounts in distinct sources. Do not sum unrelated keys or "
"present a failed query as zero usage."
msgstr ""
"每个结果包含若干 `ProviderQuotaUsage` 行，字段包括 `label`、`used`、`limit`、`unit` 和可选的带时区 `reset_at`。部署定义的 "
"provider 标识将来源关联到路由，并不是写死的供应商枚举。`quota_source.provider`、`usage_label` 和 `unit` "
"必须与返回的结果及用量行精确匹配。报告该配额池共享账户及窗口的用量，独立账户应使用不同的来源。不要把不相关密钥的用量相加，也不要把查询失败表示成零用量。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:939
msgid ""
"The UI can display percentages, currencies and other units, but RouteWise's quota admission "
"consumes one **request** at a time and requires a compatible count-based source. A percentage "
"alone is not a request allowance. The source owns window boundaries and reset times; "
"`quota.limit` is a cross-check against its reported limit, not a replacement measurement. A "
"source with no successful snapshot stays unready. A failed refresh does not manufacture a fresh "
"balance; an existing pool retains its last successful snapshot and local increments."
msgstr ""
"UI 可以显示百分比、货币和其他单位，但 RouteWise "
"的配额准入每次消耗一次**请求**，要求兼容的计数型来源。只有百分比不足以表示可用请求数。来源负责窗口边界和重置时间；`quota.limit` "
"用于核对来源报告的上限，不能替代实际测量。没有成功快照的来源保持未就绪状态。刷新失败不会凭空产生新的余额；已有的池保留上一次成功快照及本地增量。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:947
msgid "Run a local quota source"
msgstr "运行本地配额来源"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:949
msgid ""
"The complete [example extension](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py) reads `/usage` "
"from the bundled fake provider. Its in-memory daily counter is only a teaching fixture, resets on"
" process restart or at UTC midnight, and is not production accounting. It uses no real account or"
" credential and is loaded only when explicitly selected through `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`."
msgstr ""
"完整的[示例扩展](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py)读取随仓库提供的模拟供应商的 "
"`/usage`。它的内存每日计数器仅用于教学，在进程重启或 UTC 午夜时重置，不能用于生产计费。它不使用真实账户或凭据，只有通过 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` "
"显式选择后才会加载。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:955
msgid ""
"After the developer setup, run these commands from the repository root in three terminals. First,"
" start a simulated quota provider:"
msgstr "完成开发环境设置后，在三个终端中从仓库根目录执行这些命令。首先启动模拟配额供应商："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:963
msgid "Then start a slower, priced fallback (its prices in the example are fictional):"
msgstr "然后启动较慢的按量计价备用路由（示例中的价格是假设值）："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:970
msgid ""
"Finally start the gateway with the opt-in [quota "
"registry](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.yaml). Name the demo token once so the "
"admin call below can reuse it:"
msgstr ""
"最后使用需要显式选择的[配额注册表](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.yaml)启动网关。先把演示用的 token "
"命名一次，下面调用管理接口时复用它："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:988
msgid ""
"These settings disable dotenv loading and user authentication and use a public demo-only admin "
"token and JWT signing secret: keep the listener on loopback and never use them for a real "
"deployment. The admin endpoint needs the signing secret even when authenticating with the demo "
"token. Read the same result the console uses:"
msgstr ""
"这些设置关闭 dotenv 加载和用户认证，并使用公开的演示专用管理令牌和 JWT "
"签名密钥：监听地址必须保持为回环地址，绝不能用于真实部署。即使使用演示令牌认证，管理端点也需要签名密钥。读取与控制台相同的结果："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:999
msgid ""
"Send several requests to calibrate the cost envelope and allow the first five-second "
"probe/snapshot cycle to finish:"
msgstr "发送几次请求以校准成本包络，并等待首个五秒探测及快照刷新周期完成："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1008
msgid ""
"The response identifies the selected fixture. Initial requests use the fallback until the quota "
"route has both a usage snapshot and cost-envelope evidence. Accepted chat requests, including "
"active probes, consume the mock quota; health, model discovery and `/usage` reads do not. To "
"simulate exhaustion, restart only the quota fixture with `--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100`; "
"after the next snapshot refresh, requests continue through the fallback. Stop each local process "
"with Ctrl+C when finished."
msgstr ""
"响应会标识选中的模拟服务。初始请求走备用路由，直到配额路由同时具备用量快照和成本包络依据。已接受的聊天请求（包括主动探测）会消耗模拟配额；健康检查、模型发现和 `/usage` "
"查询不会。要模拟额度耗尽，只需使用 `--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100` 重启配额模拟服务；下一次快照刷新后，请求继续由备用路由服务。完成后使用 Ctrl+C"
" 停止各个本地进程。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1016
msgid ""
"To see the card in the authenticated Web/Admin Console, configure this same extension and "
"registry on a local full-stack demo backend, then open **Providers → Quotas**. Use a quota "
"endpoint reachable from that backend: inside Compose, `127.0.0.1` denotes the backend container, "
"not the host. The [Router Tutorial](router-tutorial.md) covers the full-stack demo and its "
"authentication. With no returned results the Quotas tab stays visible and links back here; "
"Overview, Keys, Availability and Performance are independent."
msgstr ""
"要在启用认证的 Web/Admin Console 中查看卡片，请在本地完整演示后端配置相同的扩展和注册表，然后打开 **Providers → "
"Quotas**。使用该后端能够访问的配额端点：在 Compose 内，`127.0.0.1` 指后端容器，而非宿主机。[路由器教程](router-"
"tutorial.md)介绍了完整演示及其认证。没有返回结果时，Quotas 标签页仍然显示，并链接回这里；Overview、Keys、Availability 和 Performance "
"功能相互独立。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1024
msgid ""
"For your own integration, copy the extension and replace its local HTTP query and mapping with "
"your authorized data source. Preserve the result contract, bound network requests with a timeout,"
" handle failures explicitly and keep credentials out of responses and logs. Supplier-specific "
"authorization and service terms still apply; using an extension is a software boundary, not an "
"exemption from them."
msgstr ""
"接入自己的服务时，请复制扩展，将本地 HTTP "
"查询及字段映射替换为已授权的数据来源。保留结果契约，为网络请求设置超时，明确处理失败，并确保响应和日志不包含凭据。供应商的授权要求及服务条款仍然适用；扩展仅划分软件边界，并不能免除这些要求。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1030
msgid "5. Upgrade checklist"
msgstr "5\\. 升级检查清单"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1032
msgid ""
"Upstream maintains the standard implementation, configuration consumers and published Site UI "
"contract. Each distribution maintains its configuration, module, deployment and any fork changes."
" Upstream merging a change does not itself define when a distribution upgrades; that is its "
"release pipeline's responsibility."
msgstr "上游维护标准实现、读取配置的代码和已公布的 Site UI 接口契约。各发行版维护自己的配置、模块、部署和源码分支修改。上游合并变更本身不会决定发行版何时升级；升级时机由发行版的发布流水线负责。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1038
msgid "An existing source fork"
msgstr "已有源码分支"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1040
msgid ""
"Inventory local changes by route and behavior. Separate branding values, public-page "
"presentation, shared-console changes and backend logic."
msgstr "按路由和行为盘点本地修改，区分品牌值、公开页面展示、共享控制台修改和后端逻辑。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1042
msgid ""
"Where they fit, move values into runtime configuration and public-page presentation into a Site "
"UI module. Migration is optional; you can keep the fork, with its ongoing merge and verification "
"work. A UI module keeps authentication controllers shared."
msgstr "将适合的配置值迁入运行时配置，将适合的公开页面展示迁入 Site UI 模块。迁移是可选的；你可以保留源码分支，并继续承担合并和验证工作。UI 模块会继续共用认证控制器。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1046
msgid ""
"Identify remaining source changes explicitly. Console redesigns, extra routes and new "
"authentication behavior do not become supported module features merely by moving files into the "
"module directory."
msgstr "明确列出仍需保留的源码修改。重新设计控制台、增加路由或新增认证行为，不会仅因相关文件移入模块目录就成为受支持的模块功能。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1049
msgid ""
"Merge the intended upstream version in an isolated branch, resolve conflicts against your "
"required behavior, and build the exact frontend/backend pair."
msgstr "在独立分支中合并目标上游版本，按所需行为解决冲突，并构建待发布的确切前端／后端组合。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1051
msgid ""
"Verify the distribution in staging before promoting it. A successful merge or upstream CI result "
"alone does not verify a fork's presentation or flows."
msgstr "在推广发布前，先在 staging 环境验证发行版。仅合并成功或上游 CI 通过，并不能验证源码分支的展示和流程。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1054
msgid ""
"Adopting Site UI can reduce future conflicts; it does not automatically migrate an existing fork "
"or make arbitrary upstream source paths stable interfaces."
msgstr "采用 Site UI 可以减少今后的冲突，但不会自动迁移已有源码分支，也不会使任意上游源码路径成为稳定接口。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1057
msgid "Before promotion"
msgstr "推广发布前"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1059
msgid ""
"Pin the upstream version and, for custom UI, the module version and produced image digest. Keep "
"the matching configuration and asset versions recoverable."
msgstr "锁定上游版本；对于自定义 UI，还应锁定模块版本和生成的镜像摘要。确保可以恢复与之匹配的配置和资源版本。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1061
msgid ""
"Read configuration/API migration notes and validate against the selected version. Unsupported "
"module API revisions must stop the build."
msgstr "阅读配置／API 迁移说明，并针对所选版本进行校验。不受支持的模块 API 版本必须使构建终止。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1063
msgid ""
"Inspect the actual image's `/app/site-ui-manifest.json` to confirm the intended standard or "
"custom build; test packaged and mounted assets over HTTP."
msgstr "检查实际镜像中的 `/app/site-ui-manifest.json`，确认构建结果使用的是预期的标准 UI 或自定义 UI；通过 HTTP 测试打包资源和挂载资源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1065
msgid ""
"Check public routes, configured links, narrow/wide layouts, keyboard access, form "
"validation/loading/errors, login/logout and the registration policy."
msgstr "检查公开路由、配置的链接、窄屏／宽屏布局、键盘操作、表单校验／加载／错误状态、登录／退出和注册策略。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1067
msgid ""
"Check the authenticated console, user/admin permissions and an inference request against the "
"deployed candidate, including any local fork behavior."
msgstr "针对已部署的候选版本检查登录后的控制台、用户／管理员权限，并发起一次推理请求，同时覆盖本地源码分支的行为。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:1069
msgid ""
"Promote only the tested image/configuration combination and retain the prior combination for "
"rollback."
msgstr "只推广经过验证的镜像与配置组合，并保留上一组以便回滚。"
